  "text": {
    "tagline": "Every machine recorded before it was sold.",
    "blurb": "We sold off a thousand office computers this year. Before each pallet went out the door, the crew recorded it: floppy drives, hard disk spin-ups, monitors, CD trays, VCRs, PC speakers, server fans, and the bugle and siren from the old civil defense room. {count} presets. FREE with any purchase over $50!",
    "intro": [
      "THANK YOU for shopping at SURPLUS CITY! This FREE BONUS DISC has {count} presets made from the machines we liquidated this year: drives, monitors, fans, speakers and more, plus four office drum kits.",
      "Every machine was recorded in the warehouse before it was sold. Some of them are in your office right now!"
    ],
    "maker_note": [
      "If it plugs in, we buy it. If it beeps, we recorded it. Come see us on Industrial Way.",
      "Big D, Surplus City"
    ],
    "install": [
      "Put the disc in. In the Library tab it shows up as OFFICEMACH.",
      "Open a folder and double-click a preset.",
      "Credits for the recordings are in CREDITS.TXT."
